# VulnSight environment configuration
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Never commit your actual .env file -- it contains secrets.
# (.gitignore already excludes .env, so you're safe by default.)

# NVD API key (optional but strongly recommended).
#
# Without a key: NVD rate-limits anonymous requests to 5 per 30 seconds.
# With a key:    NVD allows 50 requests per 30 seconds.
#
# A cold scan of an image with 1000+ CVEs will be ~10x faster with a key.
#
# Request a free key (5 minute signup) at:
#     https://nvd.nist.gov/developers/request-an-api-key
NVD_API_KEY=
